 @AddOhms  Ive spend my whole night without sleeping to get a mosfet switch done. It was me destroying the mosfet Drain (its on the Backpad) by overheating it. I got a new one and just connected it with a aligator clip and everything worked.
It seems that the back pad is very difficult to solder. I scratch the back till i see bare metal and even tried Acid as a flux but nothing works. 
But ok i know what was wrong now.
